{"id":4070,"date":"2021-01-31T12:59:43","date_gmt":"2021-01-31T12:59:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?page_id=4070"},"modified":"2025-12-03T11:22:34","modified_gmt":"2025-12-03T11:22:34","slug":"setkani-uzivatelu","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/skoleni-a-kurzy\/setkani-uzivatelu\/","title":{"rendered":"Setk\u00e1n\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4070\" class=\"elementor elementor-4070\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8771b81 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8771b81\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7f2e6d9\" data-id=\"7f2e6d9\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20c0a1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"20c0a1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Molekulov\u00e1 spektroskopie 2025<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83d960f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"83d960f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Jsme velmi r\u00e1di, \u017ee jsme se s v\u00e1mi mohli setkat v z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed 2025 v <a href=\"https:\/\/treeoflife.cz\/hotel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hotelu Tree of Life L\u00e1zn\u011b B\u011blohrad<\/a> a budeme se t\u011b\u0161it, \u017ee se s v\u00e1mi setk\u00e1me na dal\u0161\u00edm ro\u010dn\u00edku na\u0161eho tradi\u010dn\u00edho setk\u00e1n\u00ed. Prob\u011bhne v roce 2028, a budeme v\u00e1s o v\u0161em v\u010das informovat.<\/p><p>C\u00edlem tohoto setk\u00e1n\u00ed je vz\u00e1jemn\u00e1 v\u00fdm\u011bna zku\u0161enost\u00ed v oboru molekulov\u00e9 spektrometrie, sezn\u00e1men\u00ed s nov\u00fdmi metodami a s novinkami v p\u0159\u00edstrojov\u00e9 technice a programov\u00e9m vybaven\u00ed. Konference se pravideln\u011b \u00fa\u010dastn\u00ed i zahrani\u010dn\u00ed host\u00e9 a hlavn\u00ed n\u00e1pln\u00ed setk\u00e1n\u00ed jsou p\u0159edn\u00e1\u0161ky u\u017eivatel\u016f.<\/p><p>Pro v\u00edce informac\u00ed n\u00e1s kontaktujte na e-mailu <a href=\"mailto:fidlerova@nicoletcz.cz\">mudronova@nicoletcz.cz<\/a><\/p><p>Po stanoven\u00ed term\u00ednu pros\u00edme o zasl\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161ky (<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/12\/5387869d.docx\">p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161ka je ke sta\u017een\u00ed zde<\/a><\/strong>) z d\u016fvodu zarezervov\u00e1n\u00ed dostate\u010dn\u00e9 kapacity v hotelu. Proto\u017ee v minul\u00fdch letech byl o semin\u00e1\u0159 velk\u00fd z\u00e1jem. P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161ky budeme evidovat v po\u0159ad\u00ed, v jak\u00e9m je obdr\u017e\u00edme. Pokud by se naplnila kapacita hotelu, budou \u00fa\u010dastn\u00edci, kte\u0159\u00ed za\u0161lou p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161ku pozd\u011bji, ubytov\u00e1ni v okoln\u00edch hotelech.<\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/12\/d8ae72da.pdf\">Program konference 2025<\/a> (L\u00e1zn\u011b B\u011blohrad)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/08\/e8d26497.pdf\">Program konference 2022<\/a> (L\u00e1zn\u011b B\u011blohrad, Hotel Tree of Life)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/f2aa8d1f.pdf\">Program konference 2017<\/a> (L\u00e1zn\u011b B\u011blohrad, Hotel Tree of Life)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/ec0835d1.pdf\">Program konference 2014<\/a> (Se\u010d, Hotel Jezerka)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/bb5fc026.pdf\">Program konference 2011<\/a> (Se\u010d, Hotel Jezerka)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/e4ec6f93.pdf\">Program konference 2008<\/a> (Hrotovice)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Molekulov\u00e1 spektroskopie 2025 Jsme velmi r\u00e1di, \u017ee jsme se s v\u00e1mi mohli setkat v z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed 2025 v hotelu Tree of Life L\u00e1zn\u011b B\u011blohrad a budeme se t\u011b\u0161it, \u017ee se s v\u00e1mi setk\u00e1me na dal\u0161\u00edm ro\u010dn\u00edku na\u0161eho tradi\u010dn\u00edho setk\u00e1n\u00ed. Prob\u011bhne v roce 2028, a budeme v\u00e1s o v\u0161em v\u010das informovat. C\u00edlem tohoto setk\u00e1n\u00ed je vz\u00e1jemn\u00e1 v\u00fdm\u011bna [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":3778,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4070","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Setk\u00e1n\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016f - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/skoleni-a-kurzy\/setkani-uzivatelu\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"cs_CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Setk\u00e1n\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016f - Nicolet CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"o